          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Three girls in a trivial and absurd argument over how to make a paper airplane. Three adults in a sophisticated and intellectual debate about the details of a historical event. Two apparently distant problems but with a common core: the inability to manage envy and ego of the two central characters, Aran, the youngest daughter, and Artur, her father.",
